  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees."
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss potatoes with oil and salt; transfer to a parchment-lined baking sheet. Roast for 20 minutes; flip, and roast again for 15 minutes until nicely golden brown."
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss cucumber salad together; let it rest for 15-20 minutes to let the flavors come together."
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sauce together until smooth."
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss chicken with the spices and olive oil to coat. Air fry fat 375 for 11-13 minutes until deeply golden and 165 degrees (or, place on the sheet pan with the potatoes and roast for 15-17 minutes). When the chicken is done, I like to cut it up into bite-sized pieces for serving in a big pile on each plate."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve chicken with the roasted potatoes, chicken, cucumber salad, warmed pita, and a dollop of sauce on a plate. Serve with lemon wedges to squeeze over the top. YUMMY!"
    }
  ],
